#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:81
msgid ""
"The ``ovphysx`` extra requires OvPhysX 0.6.4.72118723. Install it from the "
"repository root with:"
msgstr "``ovphysx`` 扩展依赖要求 OvPhysX 0.6.4.72118723。在仓库根目录执行以下命令安装："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:87
msgid ""
"The ``--inexact`` flag preserves packages installed through other extras. "
"Use ``--extra ov`` to install both public OvPhysX and OVRTX runtimes. The "
"combined extra pairs OVRTX 0.5.1.385782 with OVStage 0.2.1; OVRTX 0.4.1 is "
"not compatible with this runtime combination."
msgstr ""
"``--inexact`` 保留通过其他 extra 安装的包。使用 ``--extra ov`` 可同时安装公开发布的 OvPhysX 和 OVRTX"
" 运行时。该组合 extra 使用 OVRTX 0.5.1.385782 与 OVStage 0.2.1；OVRTX 0.4.1 与此运行时组合不兼容。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:93
msgid "Opt-in OVPhysX 0.7 support"
msgstr "可选的 OVPhysX 0.7 支持"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:95
msgid ""
"The default dependency pins remain on OVPhysX 0.6.4. The backend also "
"accepts OVPhysX 0.7, including development builds. It selects task "
"completion, stage teardown, scene reads and schema discovery from the "
"installed runtime version. Tensor and contact bindings remain in use on both"
" versions."
msgstr ""
"默认依赖仍固定为 OVPhysX 0.6.4。后端也接受 OVPhysX "
"0.7，包括开发版本，并根据已安装的运行时版本选择任务完成、舞台销毁、场景读取和 Schema 查找方式。两个版本均继续使用张量和接触绑定。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:100
msgid ""
"OVPhysX 0.7 no longer bundles PhysX USD schemas. Install ``physx-usd-"
"schemas>=25.11.2`` into the simulation environment before startup. Use ``uv "
"run --no-sync`` with an opt-in environment to avoid restoring the project's "
"default dependency pins. Isaac Lab locates both PhysX and deformable schema "
"directories without importing the provider, then registers them before USD "
"population. The already-installed Newton schemas are also registered. Do not"
" suppress schema-registration errors: late registration requires a fresh "
"process and cannot recover settings lost during population."
msgstr ""
"OVPhysX 0.7 不再自带 PhysX USD Schema。启动前，请在仿真环境中安装 ``physx-usd-"
"schemas>=25.11.2``。对这类自行调整依赖的环境，请使用 ``uv run --no-sync``，避免恢复项目默认的依赖版本。Isaac"
" Lab 会在不导入提供方模块的情况下定位 PhysX 和可变形体 Schema 目录，并在填充 USD 场景前注册；已安装的 Newton "
"Schema 也会注册。请勿忽略 Schema 注册错误：注册过晚时必须重启进程，而且无法恢复填充场景时丢失的设置。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:110
msgid "Legacy joint USD"
msgstr "旧版关节 USD"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:112
msgid ""
"OVPhysX 0.7 no longer consumes ``PhysxJointAPI``. In the temporary physics "
"export, Isaac Lab translates authored ``physxJoint:maxJointVelocity`` and "
"``physxJoint:armature`` to ``NewtonJointAPI`` values. Angular velocity stays"
" in USD degrees per second; linear velocity and armature retain their USD "
"units. Authored modern values take precedence, and existing per-axis PhysX "
"overrides remain intact. Source assets and the live stage are not edited, so"
" other physics backends and older OVPhysX runtimes keep their previous "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"OVPhysX 0.7 不再读取 ``PhysxJointAPI``。在临时物理导出文件中，Isaac Lab 会将已有的 "
"``physxJoint:maxJointVelocity`` 和 ``physxJoint:armature`` 转换为 "
"``NewtonJointAPI`` 值。角速度仍使用 USD 的度每秒单位，线速度和转子惯量也保留原有 USD 单位。已写入的新格式值优先，现有的分轴"
" PhysX 覆盖设置保持不变。源资产和实时舞台不被修改，因此其他物理后端及旧版 OVPhysX 运行时仍保持原先行为。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:120
msgid ""
"Unmigrated nonzero legacy ``physxJoint:jointFriction`` is rejected with the "
"joint path. The dimensionless coefficient has no exact conversion to the new"
" effort-based friction model. Remove it and retune ``newton:friction`` / "
"``newton:damping`` or ``PhysxJointAxisAPI`` friction efforts explicitly. "
"Unsupported joint types and time-sampled legacy settings that cannot be "
"represented also require migration. This compatibility layer does not "
"promise identical trajectories across PhysX engine versions."
msgstr ""
"若仍存在未迁移的非零 "
"``physxJoint:jointFriction``，后端会拒绝加载并报告关节路径。该无量纲系数无法精确转换为基于力/力矩的新摩擦模型，需要移除它，并显式重新调整"
" ``newton:friction`` / ``newton:damping`` 或 ``PhysxJointAxisAPI`` "
"的摩擦力/力矩。不受支持的关节类型，以及无法表示的带时间采样的旧设置，同样需要迁移。此兼容层不保证不同 PhysX 引擎版本生成完全相同的轨迹。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:128
msgid ""
"For scene-time migration without republishing assets, set "
"``OvPhysxCfg.legacy_joint_friction_replacements`` to a mapping from joint-"
"name regular expressions to ``(static effort, dynamic effort, viscous "
"coefficient)``. The values use SI force/torque and viscous units. Only "
"matching revolute and prismatic joints with nonzero legacy friction are "
"migrated in the private 0.7 export: the legacy property is removed and "
"modern ``PhysxJointAxisAPI`` values are authored. Existing modern friction "
"opinions take precedence. Other runtimes, source USD files, and the live "
"stage remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"若希望在加载场景时迁移而无需重新发布资产，可将 ``OvPhysxCfg.legacy_joint_friction_replacements`` "
"设为从关节名称正则表达式到 ``(static effort, dynamic effort, viscous coefficient)`` "
"的映射，数值采用 SI 制的力/力矩和黏性系数单位。在内部的 0.7 导出中，仅迁移匹配到且旧摩擦非零的旋转或移动关节：删除旧属性，写入新的 "
"``PhysxJointAxisAPI`` 值。已有的新格式摩擦设置优先。其他运行时、源 USD 文件和实时舞台均保持不变。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:137
msgid ""
"The Allegro reorientation, Kuka-Allegro lift/reorientation, Shadow "
"reorientation, and Shadow handover presets supply replacements for their "
"affected hand joints. The profile is ``(0.01, 0.0, 0.0)``: 0.01 N*m static "
"effort, zero dynamic effort, and zero viscous coefficient. These values "
"match measured OVPhysX 0.6.4 runtime actuator settings, including the Shadow"
" tendon joints; they are not a numeric conversion of the legacy asset "
"coefficients. Actuator initialization and runtime friction randomization "
"continue using effort-valued tensor properties. Merely copying a legacy "
"coefficient into a modern effort property is not a valid migration."
msgstr ""
"Allegro 重定向、Kuka-Allegro 抬升/重定向、Shadow 重定向和 Shadow 双手交接预设，为受影响的手部关节提供了替换值 "
"``(0.01, 0.0, 0.0)``：静摩擦力矩为 0.01 N*m，动摩擦和黏性系数为零。这些值与测得的 OVPhysX 0.6.4 "
"运行时执行器设置一致，包括 Shadow "
"肌腱关节；它们不是将旧资产系数直接做数值转换得到的。执行器初始化和运行时摩擦随机化仍使用以力/力矩计的张量属性。将旧系数直接复制到新属性中，并不是正确的迁移方式。"

