#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:213
msgid ""
"OvPhysX 0.6.3 is required for heterogeneous runtime cloning. Tensor bindings"
" use numeric environment order so indexed resets, actions and observations "
"address the correct variant. Variants may differ in geometry but must "
"preserve body, joint and tendon layout. Isaac Lab checks prototype rotation "
"axes and tendon layouts; OVPhysX checks body and joint metadata when binding"
" articulations."
msgstr ""
"异构运行时克隆要求 OvPhysX "
"0.6.3。张量绑定按环境的数字顺序排列，保证索引式重置、动作和观测对应正确变体。变体的几何可以不同，但刚体、关节和肌腱布局必须一致。Isaac Lab"
" 检查原型旋转轴和肌腱布局；OVPhysX 在绑定关节体时检查刚体与关节元数据。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:219
msgid ""
"The clone context compiles the plan's prototypes and world assignments once."
" The physics manager attaches one exported stage, replays the native copies,"
" and warms the runtime before assets and sensors bind. Hard reset reuses the"
" same declarations; there is no separate consumable queue. Binding paths "
"come from the plan's world layout and environment template, not from native "
"clone order."
msgstr ""
"克隆上下文只编译一次计划中的原型和仿真世界分配。物理管理器挂接一个导出的 USD "
"舞台，重放原生副本，并在资源和传感器绑定之前预热运行时。硬重置复用相同声明，不另设一次性消费队列。绑定路径来自计划的世界布局和环境模板，而不是原生克隆顺序。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:225
msgid ""
"Configured scenes author only prototypes before replication. Environment "
"poses come from the clone plan: USD replication creates frames for Kit, and "
"OVPhysX places originals in its private import before native cloning. OVRTX "
"and OVStage populate their required environment frames in private USD "
"exports, then apply the planned poses. The SDK's CPU hierarchy computation "
"requires USD-populated frames. Export filtering still excludes unrouted "
"prototypes and any destinations already materialized by USD replication."
msgstr ""
"配置场景时，复制前只创建原型。环境位姿来自克隆计划：USD 复制为 Kit 创建坐标框架，OVPhysX "
"则在原生克隆前，将原始环境按位姿放入其内部导入场景。OVRTX 和 OVStage 在内部 USD "
"导出中填充所需的环境坐标框架，再应用计划中的位姿。SDK 的 CPU 层级计算要求这些坐标框架已填充到 USD。导出过滤仍会排除未路由的原型，以及已由 "
"USD 复制创建的目标。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:231
msgid ""
"Authored sources all receive native environment ID zero. Every world "
"containing a source or USD-only physics therefore imports all its declared "
"assets as originals. Other worlds clone their assets from a complete "
"original world of the same composition, using one native environment ID per "
"destination world. This keeps a robot, table and object able to contact one "
"another without destination placeholders. Only declared asset subtrees are "
"copied; unrelated authored assets are retained."
msgstr ""
"所有写入 USD 的源对象均获得原生环境 ID 零。因此，包含源对象或仅通过 USD "
"定义物理的每个仿真世界，都会将其声明的全部资源作为原始对象导入。其他世界从组成相同、完整的原始世界克隆资源，每个目标世界使用一个原生环境 "
"ID。这样，机器人、桌子和物体可以相互接触，无需目标占位对象。只复制声明的资源子树，其他写入 USD 的资源保持不变。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:238
msgid ""
"Keep :attr:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg.filter_collisions` enabled "
"to isolate original worlds with USD collision groups. Native GPU physics "
"copies additionally use native environment-ID filtering. When :ref:`shared "
"OVStage cloning <ov-clone-routing>` is enabled, both backends attach to one "
"OVStage and clone it once; these copies use the authored USD collision "
"groups. Native physics cloning remains the default while shared-stage cold "
"binding lookup is slow in OVPhysX 0.6.3. CPU has no native environment-ID "
"filtering in OvPhysX 0.6.3, so it imports all declared USD copies and uses "
"collision groups. Large overlapping original layouts can still exhaust "
"broadphase pair capacity; use spatially separated environments."
msgstr ""
"请保持 :attr:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg.filter_collisions` 启用，利用 USD "
"碰撞组隔离原始世界。原生 GPU 物理副本还会使用原生环境 ID 过滤。启用 :ref:`共享 OVStage 克隆 <ov-clone-"
"routing>` 时，两个后端附加到同一个 OVStage，并且只克隆一次；这些副本使用场景中写入的 USD 碰撞组。由于 OVPhysX 0.6.3"
" 中共享舞台首次查找绑定较慢，默认仍采用原生物理克隆。OvPhysX 0.6.3 的 CPU 不支持原生环境 ID 过滤，因此会导入所有声明的 USD "
"副本并使用碰撞组。大量原始环境若彼此重叠，仍可能耗尽碰撞粗检测的配对容量，因此应将环境在空间上分开。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:249
msgid "Deformable limitations"
msgstr "可变形体限制"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:251
msgid ""
"OvPhysX deformables currently require every body matched by one "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` to have the same number of "
"simulation nodes. Initialization raises an error for mixed node counts "
"instead of exposing padded state that would produce incorrect reductions."
msgstr ""
"目前 OvPhysX 要求同一个 :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` "
"匹配到的所有物体具有相同数量的仿真节点。节点数量不同时，初始化会报错，而不会暴露填充后的状态，以免产生错误的归约结果。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:256
msgid ""
"Deformable scenes also require full-stage materialization. Startup cost "
"therefore grows with the number of authored environments. Use this path for "
"small validation scenes; training-scale workloads with thousands of "
"environments are not currently supported. Deformable bodies are not "
"supported by the heterogeneous fast-path cloner."
msgstr ""
"可变形体场景还要求将整个 USD "
"舞台实例化展开，因此启动开销会随已定义环境数量增加。这条路径适合小规模验证场景，目前不支持数千个环境的训练规模工作负载。异构快速克隆器不支持可变形体。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:265
msgid "Native access"
msgstr "访问原生接口"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:267
msgid ""
"Use native access when the shared asset and sensor APIs do not expose the "
"data or operation you need. Reuse an Isaac Lab-owned handle when its "
"selection matches; create raw access only for additional capabilities. "
"Native writes can bypass Isaac Lab's caches and validation, so follow the "
"ownership and synchronization rules below."
msgstr ""
"当共享的资产和传感器 API 未提供所需数据或操作时，可使用原生访问接口。如果 Isaac Lab "
"持有的句柄已覆盖所需对象，请直接复用；只有需要额外功能时才创建底层访问对象。原生写入可能绕过 Isaac Lab "
"的缓存和校验，因此须遵循下述所有权与同步规则。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:273
msgid "Mental model"
msgstr "基本概念"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:275
msgid ""
"OvPhysX exposes generic ``TensorBinding`` objects. A binding combines a prim"
" selection with one installed ``TensorType``; it is not an asset-specific "
"native storage object. Callers explicitly pull values into their own buffer "
"with ``read()`` and push a buffer back with ``write()``. Isaac Lab "
"optionally wraps these bindings in "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` for a string-keyed, guarded "
"convenience surface."
msgstr ""
"OvPhysX 暴露通用的 ``TensorBinding`` 对象。一个绑定将 prim 选择与已安装的一种 ``TensorType`` "
"结合，并不是某个资源专用的原生存储对象。调用方通过 ``read()`` 显式将值读入自己的缓冲区，再通过 ``write()`` "
"将缓冲区写回。Isaac Lab 可以选择使用 :class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` "
"包装这些绑定，提供以字符串为键、带检查的便捷接口。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:283
msgid "Lifecycle prerequisite"
msgstr "生命周期前提"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:285
msgid ""
"Create bindings only after the OvPhysX simulation has initialized and reset,"
" when its native runtime is live. A stage reload, a reset path that rebuilds"
" the stage or runtime, and manager teardown invalidate all existing bindings"
" and views. Reacquire them afterwards."
msgstr ""
"仅在 OvPhysX 仿真完成初始化和重置、原生运行时已就绪后创建绑定。重新加载 USD "
"舞台、重建舞台或运行时的重置流程，以及管理器清理，都会使所有已有绑定和视图失效，之后需要重新获取。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:290
msgid ""
"Get the active OvPhysX handle from the manager after the lifecycle "
"prerequisite:"
msgstr "满足生命周期前提后，从管理器获取当前 OvPhysX 句柄："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:298
msgid ""
"A non-``None`` handle proves only that the manager constructed an OvPhysX "
"instance; it is not a readiness predicate for the current simulation "
"context. Manager teardown releases the instance and clears this handle. "
"Initialize and reset the current context before access, and always reacquire"
" the handle before creating new bindings or views."
msgstr ""
"句柄非 ``None`` 只说明管理器已构建 OvPhysX "
"实例，并不表示当前仿真上下文已经就绪。管理器清理时会释放实例并清空句柄。访问前先初始化并重置当前上下文，创建新绑定或视图前始终重新获取句柄。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:304
msgid "Reuse Isaac Lab-owned access"
msgstr "复用 Isaac Lab 持有的访问对象"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:306
msgid ""
"Reuse the convenience view already owned by an Isaac Lab asset when its "
"selection matches:"
msgstr "如果选择符合需要，复用 Isaac Lab 资源已经持有的便捷视图："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:315
msgid "Create raw access"
msgstr "创建底层访问"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:317
msgid ""
"Create a raw binding when the desired selection is not already owned by an "
"Isaac Lab asset. The following representative pose binding is float32 and "
"uses the simulation device; it is not a generic allocator for every tensor "
"type:"
msgstr ""
"所需选择尚未由 Isaac Lab 资源持有时，创建原始绑定。以下示例位姿绑定使用 float32 和仿真设备，并不是适用于所有张量类型的通用分配器："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:342
msgid ""
"Before allocating a buffer, inspect ``binding.shape``, ``binding.dtype``, "
"the binding's count, and its path metadata. Match the binding shape and "
"DLPack scalar metadata exactly, and respect the binding's native device and "
"access mode. ``RIGID_BODY_POSE`` has the float32 layout used above, but "
"another tensor type can have a different scalar dtype, shape, native device,"
" or write permission."
msgstr ""
"分配缓冲区前，检查 ``binding.shape`` 、 ``binding.dtype`` 、绑定数量和路径元数据。必须精确匹配绑定形状与 "
"DLPack 标量元数据，并遵守原生设备和访问模式要求。 ``RIGID_BODY_POSE`` 使用上方的 float32 "
"布局，但其他张量类型的数据类型、形状、原生设备或写入权限可能不同。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:348
msgid ""
"For a new selection, construct :class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` "
"with the native runtime and a Tensor API pattern:"
msgstr ""
"对于新选择，使用原生运行时和 Tensor API 模式构建 :class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` ："

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:368
msgid ""
"``try_binding_for`` attempts to create a binding for this selection and "
"returns ``None`` when a valid type is unavailable. ``binding_for`` returns a"
" raw binding and bypasses the view's device, dtype, shape, and read-only "
"guards."
msgstr ""
"``try_binding_for`` 尝试为该选择创建绑定，没有有效类型时返回 ``None`` 。 ``binding_for`` "
"返回原始绑定，会绕过视图的设备、数据类型、形状和只读检查。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:373
msgid "Read/write semantics"
msgstr "读写语义"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:375
msgid ""
"Raw ``binding.read(buffer)`` calls pull values into caller-owned buffers, "
"while ``binding.write(buffer)`` calls push values to the simulation. Editing"
" a local buffer alone does not change the simulation. The guarded "
":meth:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView.get_attribute`, "
":meth:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView.read_into`, and "
":meth:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView.set_attribute` paths provide the "
"same pull/push boundary while validating the binding's shape, scalar dtype, "
"native device, and writable access."
msgstr ""
"原始 ``binding.read(buffer)`` 将值读入调用方持有的缓冲区， ``binding.write(buffer)`` "
"则将值写入仿真。仅修改本地缓冲区不会改变仿真。带检查的 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView.get_attribute` 、 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView.read_into` 和 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView.set_attribute` "
"具有相同的读取与写回边界，同时验证绑定形状、标量数据类型、原生设备和写入权限。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:385
msgid "Ownership, synchronization, and invalidation"
msgstr "所有权、同步与失效"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:387
msgid ""
"Allocate buffers on the binding's required device and match its shape and "
"DLPack scalar metadata. State tensors normally use the simulation device, "
"while some property tensors are CPU-only. "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` validates these requirements and"
" can reinterpret supported flat scalar layouts as structured Warp values, "
"but it does not move data between CPU and GPU."
msgstr ""
"在绑定要求的设备上分配缓冲区，并匹配其形状与 DLPack 标量元数据。状态张量通常使用仿真设备，部分属性张量则仅支持 CPU。 "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` 验证这些要求，并可将受支持的平坦标量布局重新解释为结构化 "
"Warp 值，但不会在 CPU 与 GPU 之间移动数据。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:393
msgid ""
"Use ``try_binding_for`` when a tensor type might not apply to the selected "
"prims. Reacquire raw bindings and convenience views after reset paths that "
"rebuild the stage or runtime, or after teardown. Destroy raw bindings and "
"close custom views before they are no longer needed. Manager teardown closes"
" tracked ``OvPhysxView`` instances before releasing the runtime, but "
"explicit cleanup avoids retaining their bindings for the rest of a long-"
"lived simulation."
msgstr ""
"如果某个张量类型可能不适用于选定 prim，请使用 ``try_binding_for`` "
"。重置流程重建舞台或运行时之后，以及清理之后，应重新获取原始绑定和便捷视图。不再需要时，应销毁原始绑定并关闭自定义视图。管理器清理会先关闭已跟踪的 "
"``OvPhysxView`` 实例，再释放运行时；显式清理可以避免在长时间运行的仿真中一直保留这些绑定。"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:401
msgid "Authoritative references"
msgstr "权威参考"

#: source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx.rst:403
msgid ""
"The generated Isaac Lab reference for "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` documents the convenience view. "
"The repository metadata pins OvPhysX to a version but does not provide a "
"versioned official OvPhysX documentation URL, so inspect the installed "
"``TensorType`` and binding metadata at runtime."
msgstr ""
"生成的 Isaac Lab :class:`~isaaclab_ov.sim.views.OvPhysxView` "
"参考文档介绍了便捷视图。仓库元数据固定了 OvPhysX 版本，但没有提供带版本的官方 OvPhysX 文档 URL，因此应在运行时检查已安装的 "
"``TensorType`` 与绑定元数据。"

